      "content": "so 2400mg is fine? thats a lot. but i keep feeling kinda nauseous and my neck feels really stiff and tight too. like i can barely look down at my chest. do u think that's just because of the pain or should i be worried about something else? i really dont want to deal with the er bills if i can just take the pills and sleep.",
